    <rotation>horizontal</rotation>
    <players>3</players>
    <num_buttons>3</num_buttons>
    <buttons names="Punch,Kick,Jump,Start,Coin" default="A,B,X,Start,R"/>

    <romstruct>
SDRAM layout, the same for every Atari G1 set (unused space is zero-filled):
000000 - 07FFFF  512K  68000 program
080000 - 27FFFF    2M  RLE motion objects
280000 - 2FFFFF  512K  playfield planes 0-3
300000 - 31FFFF  128K  playfield plane 4
320000 - 33FFFF  128K  alpha characters
340000 - 37FFFF  256K  OKI6295 samples
380000 - 38FFFF   64K  JSA II 6502 program
390000 - 3905FF  1.5K  motion object PROMs
    </romstruct>

    <rom index="0" zip="pitfight2.zip|pitfight.zip" md5="f7053bbb551399bc603b3f1a6e0fcce5">

